Z||000000||NOS3800||10-25-2001||11:54 PM||||On November 10th, Maryland international raceway will be open for a test and tune from 11am-7pm. This means for 30 bucks you can show up and run as many times as you want, with a very low turnout, its a test and tune, not an actual race. Anyone interested in going? My brother(SC3800) and I are thinking of going, great chance to tinker with things. The next day(Sunday) will be theWorld Cup Nationals, pitching IMPORTS vs. DOMESTICS. We are planning on running in this event also. Let me know.<P>------------------<BR>Purple 1988 GT<BR>NOS injected 3800 Series II V6<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Sig_Pic,_nos3800_3.jpg"> <BR>Best ET(75 shot)-13.21@102.13 mph<BR>w/o NOS 14.86@92.06mph||||reg||1
